# Crash and Burn, first mode: "Destroy target Vehicle" (CR 700.2, 701.8, 301.7). Bot2 has a Smuggler's Copter (an uncrewed Vehicle, so not a
# creature), an Ornithopter (an artifact creature, no Vehicle), a Savannah Lions and a Mox Jet. On turn 3 the target question refuses all
# three (a Vehicle is an artifact with that subtype, nothing else is) and takes the Copter, which is destroyed. On turn 5 the second takes
# Bot1's own Reckoner Bankbuster: a Vehicle of the caster's own is just as legal, and goes too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Reckoner Bankbuster
Crash and Burn
Crash and Burn
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
